      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Talk track: Factory creates the object. Processor runs the shop. Order only allows legal status changes.\nCatalog does not store 10 units \u2014 Inventory does. Product is merchandising. Reservation is the proof of what was taken.\nCreate \u2260 submit. Validation \u2260 reservation. Notification cannot undo COMPLETED or FAILED.",
      "originalText": "Talk track: Factory creates the object. Processor runs the shop. Order only allows legal status changes.\nCatalog does not store 10 units \u2014 Inventory does. Product is merchandising. Reservation is the proof of what was taken.\nCreate \u2260 submit. Validation \u2260 reservation. Notification cannot undo COMPLETED or FAILED.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "say",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
